35,2,1,talk,Minato,,The coordination group is just two people writing everything by hand.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,Half the customer plants lose signal for whole afternoons.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,George,,"The capital line is frozen, but the software allowance has room.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,May,,Tools needing daily entry from everyone were quietly dropped.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Midori,,We lose an hour daily just copying details that already exist.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@George, so we can't build new things in-house right now?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Minato, the developers are stuck on the accounting upgrade.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,George,,"@Jonathan, exactly. But we can buy fixed-fee work.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,May,,"@Midori, the misrouted deliveries are because units have different addresses.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@May, yes, and the clerks keep asking for the same certificates.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Minato,,"If we can't build, maybe we should buy a tool that helps the two people?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,The standardization efforts failed because they had no owner.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,George,,Fixed-fee work is stable. Per-head licences get expensive fast.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,May,,The narrow tools for one trade still run. The broad ones died.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Midori,,A tool that stops the copying would save that hour daily.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Minato,,I think a tool for the coordination group makes sense.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,But who owns it? The last four standardization efforts failed.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,George,,"If it is a fixed-fee build, the cost is predictable.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,May,,It needs to be narrow. Not for everyone. Just for the coordination.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Midori,,It addresses the daily loss directly. I support that.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
